      "name": "CompareUnicodeCharValues",
      "signature": "int CompareUnicodeCharValues(ushort * pEntry1, ushort * pEntry2)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Compares two Unicode character entries by their second ushort value.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Extract ushort at offset +2 from first entry\n2. Extract ushort at offset +2 from second entry\n3. Return difference (entry1 - entry2)\n\nParameters:\n- pEntry1 (ushort*): First Unicode entry pointer\n- pEntry2 (ushort*): Second Unicode entry pointer\n\nReturns:\n- Negative if entry1 < entry2\n- Zero if entry1 == entry2\n- Positive if entry1 > entry2\n\nRelated Functions:\n- FUN_6fc44e78: Binary search using this as comparator\n- Unicode::sysWidth: Uses for Unicode-to-system lookup\n- Unicode::unicode2Sys: Uses for Unicode-to-system conversion",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
