      "name": "LoadAndValidateStringTable",
      "signature": "D2LangTblHeader * LoadAndValidateStringTable(char * szFilePath)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "D2LangTblHeader *",
      "comment": "Loads and validates a D2 language string table file.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load file via FUN_6fc44882 into memory as D2LangTblHeader\n2. Validate dwIndexStart < dwIndexEnd (data range)\n3. Compute CRC-16 over bytes from dwIndexStart to dwIndexEnd\n4. Compare computed CRC against stored wVersion (header CRC field)\n5. Iterate through nHashCount string nodes:\n   - Validate each node's dwKeyOffset < dwDataEnd\n   - Validate each node's dwStringOffset < dwDataEnd\n\nParameters:\n- szFilePath (char*): Path to .tbl file (e.g., \"data\\local\\lng\\ENG\\string.tbl\")\n\nReturns:\n- D2LangTblHeader*: Pointer to loaded/validated table header, or result of error handler\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x11 (17): Size of each string node entry\n- 0xFFFF: Initial CRC seed value\n- DAT_6fc4d7e0: CRC-16 lookup table",
