      "name": "GetOrCreateUntranslatedString",
      "signature": "void GetOrCreateUntranslatedString(byte * pbKey)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Returns a cached Unicode string for an untranslated key, creating one if not found.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Search linked list cache (g_pUntranslatedCache) for matching key\n2. If found, return cached Unicode pointer\n3. If not found, allocate new cache node via Ordinal_10042\n4. Copy key string and append \" - not xlated call ken w\" suffix\n5. Convert concatenated string to Unicode via Unicode::toUnicode\n6. Store in cache and return new Unicode pointer\n\nParameters:\n- pbKey (byte*): Null-terminated string key to look up\n\nReturns:\n- Unicode pointer to cached/created untranslated string\n\nStructure Layout (cache node):\n| Offset | Type   | Field      |\n|--------|--------|------------|\n| 0x00   | ptr    | pUnicode   |\n| 0x04   | ptr    | szKeyCopy  |\n| 0x08   | ptr    | pNext      |\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x272 (626): Fog allocation size for cache node (12 bytes)\n- 0x27d (637): Fog allocation for key copy buffer\n- 0x285 (645): Fog allocation for concatenated string\n- 0x28a (650): Fog allocation for Unicode buffer\n- 0x290 (656): Fog deallocation for temp buffer\n\nRelated Functions:\n- Ordinal_10013: Caller that uses this for missing translations",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "STR",
      "index": "STR:e007fc0690a9bd229b429dbf28b60b45",
