      "name": "GetStringIndexFromKey",
      "signature": "uint GetStringIndexFromKey(char * szKey, uint * pdwIndex)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "uint",
      "comment": "Looks up a string key in the string tables and returns its index.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Assert base and patch string tables are loaded\n2. Assert szKey is not NULL\n3. If szKey is empty string, return static empty string pointer\n4. Search patch table (index + 10000 offset)\n5. Search expansion table (index + 20000 offset)\n6. Search base table (no offset)\n7. If not found, create untranslated string entry\n\nParameters:\n- szKey (char*): String key to look up (e.g., \"strname\")\n- pdwIndex (uint*): Output - receives string index or untranslated string pointer\n\nReturns:\n- String index with table offset (0=base, +10000=patch, +20000=expansion)\n- High word zeroed if returning pointer in pdwIndex\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 10000 (0x2710): Patch string table index offset\n- 20000 (0x4E20): Expansion string table index offset",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "CAL",
      "index": "CAL:d7fb90711d9418068d8528a7f20da163",
