      "name": "ValidateAndGetFileSize",
      "signature": "uint ValidateAndGetFileSize(uint dwUnused, int nFileHandle)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "uint",
      "comment": "Validates a file handle and returns its file size.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if nFileHandle is NULL, assert if invalid\n2. Call GetFileSize with the file handle\n3. If file size is 0, retrieve file name via GetKeyValue\n4. Assert with handle info showing the file path\n5. Return the file size value\n\nParameters:\n- dwUnused (uint): Unused parameter passed in ECX (preserved for calling convention)\n- nFileHandle (int): File handle to query for size\n\nReturns:\n- uint: File size in bytes\n- Never returns if handle is NULL or file size is 0 (asserts and terminates)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "CAL",
