      "name": "LoadArchiveFile",
      "signature": "void * LoadArchiveFile(HD2ARCHIVE__ * pArchive, char * szFilePath, int * pnBytesRead, char * szSourceFile, int nSourceLine)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void *",
      "comment": "Loads a file from an MPQ archive into memory.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Open file in archive via Ordinal_10102 (Fog.OpenArchiveFile)\n2. On failure, get last error and log via Ordinal_10026, then call error handler\n3. Validate file handle and get file size via ValidateFileHandle\n4. Allocate buffer via Ordinal_10042 (Fog.MemAlloc) using file size\n5. If allocation fails, return NULL\n6. Read file contents into buffer via ReadFileAndValidate\n7. Validate read succeeded, on failure log and call error handler\n8. Close file handle via Ordinal_10103 (Fog.CloseArchiveFile)\n9. Store file size in pnBytesRead output if provided\n10. Return pointer to allocated buffer\n\nParameters:\n- pArchive (HD2ARCHIVE__*): MPQ archive handle from Storm\n- szFilePath (char*): Path to file within archive\n- pnBytesRead (int*): Output - bytes read, or NULL if not needed\n- szSourceFile (char*): Debug source file for error logging\n- nSourceLine (int): Debug source line for error logging\n\nReturns:\n- void*: Allocated buffer with file contents on success\n- NULL: On allocation failure (file open errors call error handler)\n\nRelated Functions:\n- LoadAndValidateStringTable, loadSysMap (callers)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "CAL",
      "index": "CAL:346e16c3250ca06339f558d21bf677c9",
