      "name": "HasCharTypeWordBreak",
      "signature": "uint HasCharTypeWordBreak(int nChar)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "uint",
      "comment": "Tests if a character has word-break properties (CT_CTYPE1 flags 0x107).\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. If g_dwLocaleMode > 1, delegate to FUN_6fc452c7 for locale-aware lookup\n2. Otherwise, look up character type in g_pwCharTypeTable directly\n3. Return masked result (non-zero if word break character)\n\nParameters:\n- wChar (int): Unicode code point to test\n\nReturns:\n- Non-zero if character has word-break type flags (C1_SPACE|C1_PUNCT|C1_CNTRL)\n- 0 if not a word-break character\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x107: CT_CTYPE1 mask (C1_SPACE=0x1|C1_PUNCT=0x2|C1_CNTRL=0x4|C1_BLANK=0x100)",
